# DFA Visualizer — Cursor rules

## DFA v6 styleguide (shared CSS)

- **Source of truth:** `dfa-v6-styleguide` repo, copied into `packages/dfa-v6-styleguide/` and imported as `@dfa-v6/styleguide`.
- **Do not** add `dm-` / `viz-` prefixes to new component classes. Use shared BEM names from the styleguide (`app-header`, `btn-comp-*`, `content-canvas`, etc.).
- **App header:** `app-header app-header--surface` + `app-header__inner`, `__start`, `__end`, `__center`, `__home-link`.
- **Toolbar ghost icons:** `btn-comp-icon--ghost` (not bordered `btn-comp-icon`).
- **Main visualization canvas:** `content-canvas`.
- **Filter sidebar:** `filter-panel`, `filter-panel__*`.
- **Gallery filter toggles:** `btn-comp-pill`, `btn-comp-pill--active`.
- **Modals / actions:** `btn-comp-primary`, `btn-comp-secondary`, `modal-*` where applicable.
